{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Ouch, My Back!", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Baby Split", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Help", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structure<br/> Can/Could + you + show/tell + me + Question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how to position myself?<br/> Could you tell me where to stand?<br/> Can you tell me how the lessons work?<br/> Could you show me what I have to do?<br/> Can you tell me who that person is?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can/Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show/tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">what</span> time it is, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> to use this?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">where</span> the washroom is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">when</span> the next train is?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also use the structure<br/> Let me show/tell + you + question word", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Let me show you how to get the ice from the drink dispenser. <br/> Let me show you where it is. <br/> Let me tell you what you should do.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use modals to give advice. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The most common modals for giving advice are:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can think of modals as \u201chelping verbs\u201d. They add meaning to the main verb of a sentence. In this case, these modals add the meaning of advice. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Should</span> is the most common modal used to give advice. <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span>  are used for giving strong advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some ice on it right away.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ought to \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"this ice on your thumb.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had better not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"step\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the line.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li>In conversation, it is common to use contractions with <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span>. </li></ul><span class=\"italic\">You'd better not step on the line.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should put some ice on it right away.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You ought to put this ice on your thumb and elevate your foot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She had better put her foot up to reduce the swelling.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "swollen", "type": "name"}, {"content": "enlarged; puffy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My thumb is quite swollen.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about injuries and accidents.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lump ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bump under the skin, caused by an injury ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think I have a lump on my foot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bruise ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a black, blue or purple mark on the skin caused by an injury ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll definitely have a bruise tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "whatsoever", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at all (used for emphasis)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "These bowling shoes offer no protection whatsoever!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dispenser", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a machine that gives out a product", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can get ice from the drink dispenser.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "swelling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an abnormal inflammation of the body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Put your foot up to reduce the swelling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to elevate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to raise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should elevate your foot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le03ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write down 4 injuries on four separate pieces of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner will do the same. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, mix the pieces of paper together. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one and tell your partner which injury you have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner will give you advice about what to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I think about different kinds of injuries and accidents.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My partner and I give different advice for each injury.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHow are your thumb and foot, V?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tNot so good ... my thumb is quite swollen. I think I have a lump on my foot. These bowling shoes offer no protection whatsoever!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tWell, you'll definitely have a nice bruise tomorrow. You should put some ice on it right away.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tIce? Where I am supposed to get ice?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOK, calm down. I'll be back."}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "25500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tExcuse me, can you show me how to use the ice machine?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: \t\tWow. Nobody ever uses that. Let me show you how to get ice from the drink dispenser.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tThat's a great idea! My friend hurt herself. She dropped a ball on her foot.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: \t\tOuch. Yeah, that hurts. She had better put her foot up to reduce the swelling.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOK, I'll let her know. Thanks."}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "51000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHere, V. You ought to put this ice on your thumb and elevate your foot.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tOK. Your turn to bowl.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHere goes nothing! Look! A baby split!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tCan you tell me what that means?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tIt means that I'll knock all the pins down next ball.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tWell, good for you. Don't trip!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tSomeone sounds jealous!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about injuries, accidents and health care.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "   I can give advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What is the worst injury you've had? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What did you do when you hurt yourself?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How did you treat your injury?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": 